{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31567","headline":"送于少监自广州还紫逻 · 李羣玉","name":"送于少监自广州还紫逻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸣臯山水似麻源，谢监东还忆故园。\n海峤烟霞轻逸翰，洛川花木待回轩。\n宦情薄去诗千首，世事闲来酒一尊。\n明日中书见颜范，始应通籍入金门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}